### IPP-1601 Progress ("done" questions) + IPP-1602 counts for the new language pages
### Use a normal UNPAID user. Put the password while testing, then put CHANGE_ME back.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@userEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp2@gmail.com
@userPassword = CHANGE_ME
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@freeId = {{freeList.response.body.data.questions.0._id}}


### 1. Login -> 200
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }


### 2. Free PHP questions -> 200, every question has "isDone": false/true (only when logged in)
# @name freeList
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?language=php&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 3. Mark the first one as done -> 200 "Marked as done", data.done true
PUT {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{freeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }


### 4. Language with counts -> doneCount 1 on the language and on that question's topic;
###    every language + topic has "difficulty": { easy, medium, hard }
GET {{baseUrl}}/languages/php
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### 5. Same as guest -> NO doneCount (difficulty is still there)
GET {{baseUrl}}/languages/php


### 6. Undo -> 200 "Marked as not done", data.done false (request 4 then shows doneCount 0)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{freeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": false }


### 7. Wrong body -> 400 "done must be true or false"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{freeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": "yes" }


### 8. A PAID question as unpaid user -> 403 NEEDS_FULL_ACCESS
###    (put the _id of a not-free question, e.g. from 1501-free-limit-history.http request 3b)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/progress/PUT_PAID_QUESTION_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }


### 9. Not logged in -> 401
PUT {{baseUrl}}/progress/{{freeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }


### ---- In the browser (by hand) ----
### /languages: cards with green/yellow/red difficulty bar; logged in: "x% done" + Start / Continue / Review.
### /languages/php: topic cards (difficulty bar + violet progress bar), ring "x of y done".
###   Tick the circle of a question -> ring and topic card update. "Next question" opens the next one.
###   Full access: finish a topic -> "🎉 ... done" + "Quiz this topic" opens the quiz with that topic chosen.
###   Guest: "Track your progress" banner, "2 free of 3", locked topic shows "Full access".
###   Dark mode and phone width look right. The whole site is violet now.
